WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.550
Phase zero, the first six months,
costs about one point eight million.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.851
It covers design, the security accreditation
package, the control plane, and a

3
00:00:09.851 --> 00:00:12.916
ten-site pilot, and it
exits on authorization,

4
00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:15.650
thirty stable days, and validated costs.

5
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.925
Phase one builds the twelve hubs and
the twenty-four distribution points.

6
00:00:19.925 --> 00:00:25.232
Phase two moves offices in waves, timed to
circuit renewals so each wave helps fund

7
00:00:25.232 --> 00:00:30.538
the next, and no old circuit retires until
its replacement telemetry is confirmed.

8
00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:34.995
Phase three adds Microsoft
365 optimization and caching,

9
00:00:34.995 --> 00:00:38.338
and retires servers only
as the gates close.

10
00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:42.220
Accreditation, not procurement,
is the critical path.
